      "writtenOn": "2018-08-15T17:35:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As a high-level question, do we expect that multiple system components will register for this? If not, could we register the callbacks at the same time we create one for a slot (and implicitly deregister when we remove one for a slot)?\n\nThere\u0027s 2 parts to that:\n1) if it\u0027s a single-registrant then it\u0027s straightforward.\n2) if it\u0027s a multi-registrant, then the creation/deletion will need to be refcounted so that we don\u0027t have a separate registrant that isn\u0027t aware that the thing is going to be deleted unless we want to provide some sort of onRemoved() notification callback to the other registrants.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 285,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 285,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "5d1c37f15db2089d456fce40310e6c8b3f3283da",
